# Quarto build output (do NOT commit the rendered site)
/_site/
**/_book/
# slides/ renders here locally; CI rebuilds it from source
**/_output/
**/.quarto/

# IMPORTANT: do NOT ignore _freeze/ — it caches executed cell results and
# MUST be committed so the GitHub Action can publish without running Python.
# (Intentionally not listing _freeze/ here.)
# -- but not the vendored reveal.js a render sometimes drops in beside
# them: 5 MB of library Quarto supplies itself, not a cell result.
**/_freeze/**/libs/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Secrets — never commit deployment secrets / API keys
.streamlit/secrets.toml
*.env
.env
